	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-riseLABO 第一弾の「ホシノ・フミナ」が成形技術のさらなる向上により改良されて登場！",
			"• レイヤードの研究進化により、肌の赤みや陰影の美しいグラデーションを成形色の厚みによる透け具合で再現。",
			"• 切り取ったゲート跡が目立たないよう全体的にゲートの接点を細かく加工。",
			"• 脇腹のゲートは組み立て後に跡が見えない位置に移動。",
			"• 水着は成形色をスポーティなダークブルーに変更。エナメルのような光沢ある成形表現により、よりリアルな質感を追求。",
			"• 揺れる水面と水しぶきをリアルに再現したクリアの専用台座と、砂浜をイメージした台紙が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-riseLABO's first model, \"Hoshino Fumina\", has been improved with further improvements in molding technology and is now available!",
			"• Through the evolution of layered research, the beautiful gradation of skin redness and shading is reproduced by the sheerness of the molded color.",
			"• The gate contacts are finely machined throughout so that the cut gate marks are not noticeable.",
			"• The flank gate has been moved to a position where no trace can be seen after assembly.",
			"• The molding color of the swimsuit has been changed to a sporty dark blue. Pursuing a more realistic texture with a glossy enamel-like molding expression.",
			"• Comes with a special clear pedestal that realistically reproduces the swaying water surface and splashing water, and a mount that resembles a sandy beach."
		]
	},
